d by the values of the query’s terms in the order the query lists them, so a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loop can name them all:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"), Velocity(dx: 3, dy: 4))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 1), Frozen())","","for (_, name, velocity) in world.query(Name.self, Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self) {","    print(name.value, velocity.dx)","    \/\/ Prints \"comet 3.0\"","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A view is a snapshot of the world it came from: changing the world while you iterate doesn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change what the view shows, though the first write to each component type copies that type’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"storage. To change components while you visit them, use one of the world’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"update","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" methods","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Narrow a view with the same methods a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query"},{"text":" offers, such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/with(_:)"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView\/without(_:)"},{"text":". Each returns a new view.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rows come in the order of the list the view walks: the storage of the queried or required type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that the fewest entities hold, or a shorter list where one applies, such as a tar